B.adk=new A.fR("taqwa","Being mindful of Allah: doing what pleases Him and staying away from what displeases Him, in public and in private.",B.b)
B.adm=new A.fR("nisab","The minimum amount of wealth a person must hold before zakat is due on it.",B.b)
B.adx=new A.fR("hawl","The lunar year that wealth is held for. Zakat on savings is due once the nisab has been held for a full hawl.",B.b)
B.aL0=s(["zakah"],t.s)
B.adv=new A.fR("zakat","The yearly giving of a set share of one\u2019s savings to people in need. It is one of the five pillars of Islam.",B.aL0)
B.adj=new A.fR("riba","Interest or usury: an extra amount charged on a loan. Islam forbids it. Scholars discuss its exact limits in detail.",B.b)
B.adA=new A.fR("qada","Making up a prayer or a fast that was missed.",B.b)
B.adi=new A.fR("tawaf","Walking around the Kaaba seven times as an act of worship, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.b)
B.ayp=s(["sa\u2019i"],t.s)
B.adB=new A.fR("sa'i","Walking seven times between the hills of Safa and Marwah, in Hajj and in Umrah.",B.ayp)
B.adC=new A.fR("Arafat","The plain near Makkah where pilgrims stand in prayer on the ninth day of Dhul-Hijjah. It is the high point of Hajj.",B.b)
B.adt=new A.fR("Muzdalifah","A place between Arafat and Mina where pilgrims stop on the night after Arafat during Hajj.",B.b)
B.adr=new A.fR("Mina","A valley near Makkah where pilgrims stay for some days during Hajj.",B.b)
B.adu=new A.fR("ihram","The state a pilgrim enters, with the intention for Hajj or Umrah, which begins the pilgrimage.",B.b)
B.adn=new A.fR("Umrah","The smaller pilgrimage to Makkah, which can be made at any time of the year.",B.b)
B.adp=new A.fR("barakah","Blessing: goodness and increase that Allah places in something, beyond what can be counted.",B.b)
B.ado=new A.fR("halal","Permitted in Islam.",B.b)
B.adz=new A.fR("haram","Forbidden in Islam.",B.b)
B.adq=new A.fR("niyyah","Intention: the decision in the heart to do an act for the sake of Allah.",B.b)
B.ads=new A.fR("sadaqah","Voluntary charity: any giving or kindness offered for the sake of Allah, beyond the required zakat.",B.b)
B.ady=new A.fR("wudu","The washing a Muslim does before prayer.",B.b)
B.adw=new A.fR("salah","Prayer, above all the five daily prayers, the second pillar of Islam.",B.b)
